# Default Skills

`integrations/skill-sources/default-skills/` stores openLifeOS bridge/fallback Skills. It is not the repository for complete self-evolution Skills or user-distilled personal Skills.

Current notes:

- Complete Wenxin Skill is installed at `evolution/organ-systems/wenxin/`.
- Complete PSP Skill is installed at `evolution/organ-systems/psp/`.
- Complete IPO Reverse Skill is installed at `evolution/organ-systems/ipo-reverse/`.
- Complete Taste Generator Skill is installed at `evolution/organ-systems/taste-generator/`.
- Do not place duplicate same-name Skill copies under `integrations/skill-sources/default-skills/`.

User-owned runtime skills and distilled meta skills should go under `capabilities/`.
